      "fine_trace_step": 9,
      "description": "Project call site that hands zlib the undersized dummy buffer together with the oversized output length derived from `bytesToRead`. The ASan crash occurs immediately below this call in `inflate_fast` when zlib writes one byte past the 24,576-byte allocation."
